  "body": "Seen while fixing #4830. `oneOffErr` (internal/gateway/claude_warmup.go) clips the helper's stderr to 300 bytes with `clip()`, which cuts bytes, so a reason whose 300th byte falls inside a multi-byte rune (Claude Code's screens are full of `─` and `❯`) ends on U+FFFD in the card. `logOneOff` (the app.log line added for #4830) cuts on rune starts; the card's cut should too, with a test whose reason puts a 3-byte rune across byte 300.",
